#. translators: %s: plugin name.
#: public/js/admin.js:4404
#, js-format
msgid "Persian Kit imports only once %s is inactive, so the two never convert dates and digits at the same time. WordPress does not let one plugin turn another off: deactivate it on the Plugins screen, then come back here."
